// BlockChain<T: RenderBlock> pipeline. The 16 components previously here
// (GuitarPedalboard, PedalBlock, BlockCardsView, BlockCard, RackView,
// RackBlock, Series500View, Series500Block, and all Effective* variants)
// have been replaced by BlockChain + BlockContent + BlockChrome500.
